Subject: [PATCH 03/49] Rebuild LiveHime app icon as vector artwork

The previous raster was cropped off-center from the concept board. Trace
the approved middle concept into fitted vector geometry, center it on the
standard macOS icon grid, and keep the SVG master and renderer in-tree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
