+++ b/build-aux/livehime/icon/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# LiveHime app icon
+
+`livehime-appicon.svg` is the master: a vector rebuild of the approved middle
+concept ("h" ribbon with a red dot), placed on Apple's 1024 px canvas with an
+824 px body and standard corner radius.
+
+`icon-geom.json` holds the same geometry in 1024 px canvas coordinates.
+Regenerate the Xcode icon set with:
+
+```sh
+swift render.swift icon-geom.json /tmp/icon-1024.png
+cd ../../../frontend/cmake/macos/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset
+for s in 16:icon_16x16 32:icon_16x16@2x 32:icon_32x32 64:icon_32x32@2x \
+         128:icon_128x128 256:icon_128x128@2x 256:icon_256x256 \
+         512:icon_256x256@2x 512:icon_512x512 1024:icon_512x512@2x; do
+  sips -z ${s%%:*} ${s%%:*} /tmp/icon-1024.png --out ${s#*:}.png
+done
+```
